	(text "UPDI / serial-UPDI header, circuit copied from EtherKeyerMini (J3,R3,D1 -> J5,R13,D4;\nEKM D2/JP2/JP3 omitted per Jason). Pin 1 VCC ref (+3V3D), 2 TXD, 3 RXD/UPDI, 4 GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262 140 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1044b112-d7a5-41de-8d59-e61b06ce6792")
	)
	(text "VERIFY (unconfirmed items on this sheet):\n- U4: Pin mux (PLAN sec.3) to be checked vs datasheet I/O mux table. Jason consigning parts.\n- C14: PLAN: series R or clamp on PB4 for DTR-rising overshoot? EKM has none.\n- J5: Replicated from EtherKeyerMini (J3); EKM has no LCSC/MPN fields - part number to choose.\n- R13: Replicated from EtherKeyerMini (R3); EKM has no LCSC/MPN fields - part number to choose.\n- D4: Replicated from EtherKeyerMini (D1); EKM has no LCSC/MPN fields - part number to choose.\n- DS1: 1.3in SPI SH1106 module. Pin order GND,VCC,SCL,SDA,DC,CS1,FS0,CS2 from PLAN pin list; pin numbering, pitch and\n   connector style unverified. Low stock - Jason sourcing.\n- C17: Debounce topology/count: PLAN lists x5 but 6 inputs (A,B,SW,3 buttons) - drawn as 6. Check vs encoder bounce\n   spec.\n- SW1: Detent/pulse count unverified."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195 238 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1937c5dc-18bf-48a1-a2fe-c9d8db0c25fe")
	)
	(text "OLED: SPI only (PA1 MOSI, PA3 SCK, PA4 CS1, PA5 DC). Never shares the Si5351 I2C bus.\nCS2 (font chip) held high by R26."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 255 130 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "389934ff-85cd-4f0b-871f-8f8130d15917")
	)
	(text "ATtiny3226 @ 8 MHz internal, 3.3 V. Optiboot over CP2102N; DTR auto-reset on PB4 (RSTPINCFG=0x3, megaTinyCore \"UPDI w/reset on PB4\"), as EtherKeyerMini C3/R4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44223ff7-bb5b-4db1-a794-4b4e5b66c59c")
	)
	(text "Pin 1 = VCC reference for programmer; board must be USB-powered while programming."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262 158 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8e6c7a9-0f86-4ef0-99a3-d7669c1d355d")
	)
